# Event id to render the seat map for. Get one by running the seed script
# from backend/ (see repo root docs/PRD.md handoff notes / frontend/README.md)
# and copying the printed EVENT_ID.
VITE_EVENT_ID=

# Optional: base URL for REST calls. Leave unset in local dev -- requests go
# through the Vite dev server proxy (see vite.config.ts) to avoid needing
# CORS on the backend. Set this to point at a deployed backend instead.
# VITE_API_BASE_URL=http://localhost:8000

# Optional: real WS seat-stream URL, once GET /events/{event_id}/stream
# exists. {eventId} is substituted automatically. Leave unset to use the
# built-in mock stream (src/lib/seatStreamTransport.ts).
# VITE_WS_URL=ws://localhost:8000/events/{eventId}/stream
